{
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitAndFemPCTalkAboutEggings.NuzzingBarksAngrilyCoughs": "[pg][say: Nuzzing!] {0} barks angrily. {1} coughs. [say: Nussing,] {2} says in a calmer tone. You wait. [say: It's just... ze way your body is right now,] {3} says eventually. [say: It... speaks to me. But zis is my problem,] {4} goes on, straightening {5} neck and nervously tapping {6} claws on the counter. [say: And I am not myself if I cannot control myself. Please, [name], ask your questions.] You look at the sad, proud basilisk and wonder when exactly the last time {7} got laid was."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitAndFemPCTalkAboutEggings.SeemsOnEdgePaces": "{0} seems very on edge today. {1} paces up and down, returns your greeting with a stiff nod, and fiddles endlessly with the stock in reach of {2} counter as you search for a topic. You ask if there's something wrong."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitAndFemPCTalkAboutEggings.SuggestOptionAddedMenu": "[pg]([say: Suggest] option added to {0}'s menu.)"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitFeminise.AndSinkActuallyWork": "[pg][say: And you sink zis will actually work?] {0} says eventually. [say: Zat it will... change me?] You honestly have no idea - and you're quite glad {1} can't see the color of it - but you tell {2} as confidently as you can that it will. {3} sighs raggedly, {4} claws trembling slightly. [say: Oh well, what is the worst that it could do - make me deaf?] A look of horror settles on {5} face as the words leave {6} mouth, but {7} manages to shake the thought away and lifts the bowl to {8} lips. [say: Sante,] {9} manages with a small smile, and then drinks."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitFeminise.CouldBackTomorrowUnevenly": "[pg][say: C... could you come back tomorrow?] says {0} unevenly. [say: Zis is... I need some time to get my 'ead around zis.] You put the books back on the counter, scratch a terrified-looking Pierre behind the ear, and take your leave."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitFeminise.DontNecessaryIngredientsFemale": "You don't have the necessary ingredients to attempt this yet."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitFeminise.FerretIngredientsCounterFemale": "You ferret out the ingredients you have collected and begin to bang them onto the counter in front of {0}, telling {1} that you've got what {2} needs. Pierre barks excitedly at the noise."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitFeminise.IWhatJustFantastic": "[pg][say: I - what?] the basilisk says, bewildered. [say: But... [name], zat was just fantasy! I was not expecting you to...] {0} lapses into silence as you grab a pewter bowl from a nearby shelf and a wooden spoon from a container full of old utensils, and begin to mix the various ingredients together. You crack the egg against the bowl and then beat it into the milk; the goop takes on a pink cake-mix texture until you pour in the ovi-elixir, which thins it as well as filling the close market stall with a rather bad, sulfuric smell. Carefully you drip in the reptilum whilst continuing to stir; eventually the liquid in front of you takes on a livid lime color. When the scent changes to that of cooking sherry you stop and step back to admire your handiwork, before pushing the bowl gently across the counter until it touches the basilisk's claws. {1} slowly clasps {2} fingers around it, staring blindly into the concoction."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitFeminise.NotWorstEverTasted": "[pg][say: Well... not ze worst sing I have ever tasted,] {0} says. [say: It could 'ave used more alcoh-hol zo. Uh. Uhhhhhhh...] {1} clenches the desk as a tremendous gurgling sound emanates from {2} gut. Pierre whines, and unconsciously both you and the dog back away from the basilisk as {3} begins to twitch and spasm. There is a grinding noise as {4} bones begin to shift; although {5} is holding onto the counter as hard as {6} can, {7} cannot stop knocking bottles and trinkets onto the floor as {8} flesh begins to move. {9} torso sucks in, a great deal of mass moving downwards; the sound of long johns giving at the seams trades with an unpleasant cracking and popping sound as {10} shoulders shift inwards. There is a sprouting sound as iridescent red feathers emerge upon {11} crown; below {12} clenched teeth and eyes, {13} jaw line softens and moves upwards. The basilisk's now slighter front bulges faintly, and with that the transformation stops, or at least the transformation you can readily observe. Judging by the way {14} gut continues to groan and the way {15} continues to clutch the wooden surface hard enough to leave yet more claw marks, something fairly significant is happening in the ruins of {16}'s long johns."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitFeminise.RequiresPurifiedSuccubusMilk": "[pg]<b>(Requires 2x Purified Succubus Milk, 1x Large Pink Egg, 1x Ovi Elixir, 1x Reptilum.)</b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitFeminise.WatchPotionSlidesDown": "[pg]You watch as the potion slides into {0} mouth and down {1} gullet. When it is all gone {2} sets the bowl down and licks {3} lips thoughtfully."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitFeminise.ZutFuckingVoiceGone": "[pg][say: Zut. Fucking. Alors,] the basilisk manages at last. The creature's voice has gone up by several octaves; although it is still deep, it now sounds rather... husky. [say: Zat was almost as bad as zat time I tried goblin food. Is... is zat me?] {0} puts a claw to {1}... no, her throat in a panic. Her hands then roam downwards and upwards, each new protuberance and crevice discovered amplifying her disquiet. [say: Zis... zis can't be real,] she mutters. [say: Zis can't actually 'ave 'appened...] She turns as if to try and shake herself out of a dream, and knocks over a pile of books with her behind. Your one salient thought as you watch is that whatever else you've managed to do to the blind basilisk, she certainly has it going on now. She stands in the fairly impressive mess the two of you have created wringing her hands, apparently unwilling to move her new physique around for fear of knocking over even more of the stock."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHairPinTFCheck.DoYouLetIt": "[pg]Do you let it?"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHairPinTFCheck.FeelHairPinHeat": "[pg]You feel the hair pin {0} gave you heat up, a gentle warmth suffusing through your body. Something tells you that if you let it, this feminine hair piece will evoke some sort of change."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHairPinTFNo.TakeOutHairPin": "[pg]You take out the hair pin for a while, the feeling fading as soon as you do so."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHairPinTFYes.HairGrowingRedFeathers": "[pg]<b>Your hair is growing again and is now a plume of short red feathers.</b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHairPinTFYes.HairPlumeRedFeathers": "[pg]<b>Your hair is now a plume of short red feathers.</b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHairPinTFYes.LetFeelingHeadTickle": "[pg]You let the feeling be, wondering what it will do. Soon your head begins to tickle and you reach up to scratch at it, only to be surprised by the softness you feel. It reminds you of the down of baby chickens, velvety soft and slightly fluffy. You look at yourself in a nearby puddle and gasp, where your hair once was, you now have red feathers, some longer and larger than others. This floppy but soft plume sits daintily on your head, reminding you of a ladies fascinator. You realize soon{0}"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHairPinTalk.AhZePinEirloom": "[pg][say: Ah, ze pin? It iz a 'eirloom from my mozzers side. I suspect it 'as simply been thrown down through generations, none wanting sumsing zat was more complex zan a shiny object. I think it 'as escaped ze taint, simply because of zis. I kept it to sell, but a better use 'as come for it. Maybe I am just sentimental, but I 'ope it reminds you of all you 'ave done for ze basilisks, and for me.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHairPinTalk.AskFeatheryHairPin": "You ask {0} about the feathery hair-pin he gave to you."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHerminise.AssureCanDoSomeday": "[pg]You assure her that she can do it someday when you're ready."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHerminise.DontNecessaryIngredientsHerm": "You don't have the necessary ingredients to attempt this yet."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHerminise.FerretIngredientsCounterHerm": "[pg]You ferret out the ingredients you have collected and begin to bang them onto the counter in front of Benoite, telling her that you've got what she needs. Pierre barks excitedly at the noise."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHerminise.GoodIdeaLayEggs": "[pg][say: Zis a good idea.] the basilisk says. [say: Zat way, I can still lay eggs and you get to lay eggs.] She lapses into silence as you grab a glass bottle from a nearby shelf and a wooden spoon from a container full of old utensils, and begin to mix the various ingredients together. You pour the liquids into the glass bottle. Carefully you drip in the reptilum whilst continuing to stir and; eventually the liquid in front of you takes on a livid lime color. You shake the bottle to get it well-mixed. When the scent changes to that of cooking sherry you stop and step back to admire your handiwork, before pushing the bowl gently across the counter until it touches the basilisk's claws. She slowly clasps her fingers around it, staring blindly into the concoction."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHerminise.InstructDrinkConcoction": "[pg]You instruct her to drink the concoction. She nods and slowly drinks the concoction until the bottle is empty. [say: I can feel it...] she slowly mutters. A bulge starts to form under her robes. [say: Ohhh... It is coming!] she announces. She opens her robes to reveal her new reptilian prick and a set of balls just above her vagina. [say: Thank you. Wis that, I can help you to lay some eggs,] she says."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHerminise.RequiresPurifiedIncubiDraft": "[pg]<b>(Requires 2x Purified Incubi Draft, 1x Purified Succubi's Delight, 1x Reptilum.)</b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitHerminise.TellCouldNewPenis": "You tell her that she could use a new penis, just like her old form."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.AskReadyStiffensSpine": "[pg]You ask if she's sure she's ready for this. Benoite stiffens her spine and draws herself up proudly. [say: I am ready. If it is your nerve zat is weak, well... I will be with eggs for anozer few days. After that, I won't be wizzem again for zome weeks. I can wait until you are ready, if you need.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.AskWhatSheMaking": "[pg]You ask her what she's making."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.AzzistYouWiz": "[pg][say: Ah, [name]! What can I azzist you wiz?]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.BellyBulgesBigPregnant": "[pg]The basilisk's belly bulges out, big as any pregnant woman back home. Her apron merely highlights the fact she's carrying the eggs you fathered."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.BellyHugelySwollenFertilized": "[pg]The basilisk's belly is hugely swollen with fertilized eggs, and you notice that she tries to avoid moving unless she has to. She's so bloated that she has given up trying to tie her apron on, and instead lets it flap idly on her engorged midriff."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.CautiouslyApproachStallCanopy": "You cautiously approach the stall. The shadow thrown by its large, overhanging canopy makes it quite difficult to see into its interior, and getting inside is made even more hazardous by the sheer volume of objects which clutter the area around it and hang out of the shelves arranged along its wooden walls. Everything Mareth has ever created or distilled seems to be here - or at least, everything Mareth has ever thrown out. Pots, pans, ugly crockery, shelves stuffed with clothing, a spice rack bulging with all manner of suspect-looking potions... you imagine you could probably find anything you'd ever want in here - or something closely resembling it - if you looked hard enough."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.ChokesOutMonDieu": "[pg][say: Do what exza- oh. Ooh. Aha, mon Dieu, [name]!] Benoite chokes out between a mix of chortles and guffaws. [say: Non [name], I know what it iz zat you are zinking. Aha,] she continues whilst still half laughing, but manages to calm herself down after a short pause, trying to return to some degree of seriousness. [say: I am just hungry. I am, how you say, having a craving for zees strange items one of my zuppliers has been selling lately. 'Cheeken eggz'? I guess my body knowz what it needs to replenish zat which it has lost?]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.DontZatAlmostBrained": "[pg][say: Don't do zat!] she complains when she recognizes it's you. [say: I almost brained you with zis skittle.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.EnterGloomAgain": "Once again, you carefully enter the gloom of Benoit's salvage shop. The proprietor sniffs the air as you enter, and then relaxes in {0} seat. [say: Allo again, [name]. What brings you 'ere?]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.EnterGloomThird": "Once again, you carefully enter the gloom of {0}'s salvage shop. The proprietor sniffs the air as you enter, and then smiles widely. [say: If it isn't my favorite customer! Do not 'ang around out zere, [name]; please, come in and let us, 'ow you say, chew ze fat.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.EnterStallLooksBlind": "As you enter the stall Benoite looks up; though her blind, milky eyes make her harder to read, she looks excited. [say: Ah! [name]; it iz good you are here... I had hope zat you would come for a vizit today.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.EnterStallSmellCooking": "When you enter the stall, you are greeted by the smell of something cooking. Investigating further brings you to the blind basilisk's small kitchen, where she is busy frying something. Her nose preoccupied with her meal, she doesn't realize you're approaching until you touch her shoulder, yelping in shock."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.EnterStomachFlatAgain": "When you enter the stall, you notice that Benoite's stomach is flat again. She gives you a toothy grin when you enter her stall. [say: I have good newz [name]! You are a fazer! {0} timez over in fact! Oh I wish zat you could have helped; but I was ztrong, ztrong enough get through it on my own,] she gushes, speaking at a mile-a-minute. She's clearly pleased with herself; and your virility."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.EyesDrawnFlatStomach": "[pg]Your eyes are drawn almost magnetically to her now flat-again stomach and the realization sinks in just where she got the eggs. You ask how she could have done such a thing."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.FlatBelliedTuckingOmelette": "The flat-bellied basilisk is tucking away into a plate laden with a heavy omelette when you arrive."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.GoAheadStareBasilisk": "[pg][say: Yes, go ahead, stare,] says the basilisk in a long-suffering tone, making you jump. [say: It is a funny joke, yes? Believe me, I wake up laughing about it every morning. At least here zey stare. In ze mountains, zey are so embarrassed zey can't even look at me. Or at least I assume zey can't.] He straightens his back and sets his jaw. [say: 'Owever, my slack-jawed friend, zis is not a freak show. Zis is Benoit's Spectacular Salvage Shop! So if you are not 'ere to buy or sell salvage... kindly piss off.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.HardlyBelieveHowPregnant": "[pg]You can hardly believe just how pregnant Benoite is - you wouldn't have imagined it was possible to carry that many fertilized eggs. She's practically immobile, and when she does get up and shuffle along, her belly nearly drags along the ground; it's that swollen with your young. Needless to say, practicality demands she goes around naked."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.LunchOmelette": "[pg][say: My lunch; an omelette,] she says."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.ObviousBulgeApronClad": "[pg]An obvious bulge in the female basilisk's apron-clad belly signals the presence of new eggs. If you were to have sex with her in this state then there's a good chance she'll end up with a belly full of fertilized eggs."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.OnceAgainEnterGloom": "Once again, you carefully enter the gloom of Benoit's salvage shop. The proprietor sniffs the air as you enter, and then looks at you sourly. [say: Well?] {0} rasps."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.PatsMidriffPiecesTogether": "[pg]She pats her midriff and you start to put the pieces together. [say: Oh. Oooh,] you mumble back as a response."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.PregnancyUnmistakableEggs": "[pg]Benoite's pregnancy is unmistakable, and the number of eggs she's carrying is quite impressive. Her apron is strained to the limit to contain her distended belly, and you wonder how she manages to tie it up each morning."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.RaspyVoiceGloom": "[pg][say: Allo?] says a raspy voice from further in the gloom. [say: 'Oo is zair?] You can make out a counter constructed from crates, and a tall, thin shape behind it - a lizan, by the looks of his build and smooth scales. Something about his shape makes you feel uneasy, though... you shift further in to take a closer look at the stall owner. He's seated in the only area of his shop not taken up by junk, right next to a heap of rugs and robes, and has a fez perched on top of his blunt head. It's when he turns his gray slit eyes to you that you realize what is putting you on edge - it's a basilisk! Panic grips you as you try to wrench your eyes away... which you do, easily. Curious despite yourself, you look back tentatively. The creature's eyes seem oddly milky, and they seem to be staring beyond you. Realization takes hold when you see the white stick balanced carefully on the counter's side."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.ShrugsNeverWasteNot": "[pg][say: What? Zey were never fertilized, so, waste not want not,] she shrugs. When you protest that they could have been her children, she gives you a blank look - though you imagine being blind helps a lot in that regard. [say: The, how you say, groinal bleeding of mammal girls could have been their children too; do they get upset about it?] she asks as a hint of mischievousness sneaks into her smirk. [say: Want some?] she innocently asks, offering you the skillet."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.StandsNervouslyStomachBulging": "[pg]She stands up somewhat nervously, and you realize that her stomach is visibly bulging, her typical outfit straining slightly to cover the bulk of her midriff. She pats it with a timid sense of pride. [say: I am wiz clutch. My womb, it haz created eggz, and zey are ready to be fertilized. I... I could be a mother now. I-if I could find myzelf a willing partner...] She trembles, despite herself; it's clear that the idea of going from lone male to expectant mother in the space of a few days is a bit much for the basilisk."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.StartsHintExcitedEnergy": "[pg][say: Zo [name],] she starts, still a hint of excited energy prevalent in her voice, [say: what can Benoite azzist you wiz?]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.TakesMomentComposeGiddy": "[pg]She takes a moment to compose herself, still giddy with the prospect of potentially finding the answer that could save her people; although the means might not be quite what she had in mind, she seems to be taking to the situation with gusto."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.TurnOfferSomethingElse": "[pg]You turn her offer down and explain you came here for something else."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.WonderBlindAnythingBazaar": "[pg]You wonder how a blind anything can make it in such a rough and ready place as the Bazaar, but then Benoit curls {0} claws protectively into what appears to be a pile of robes sitting next to {1}, which opens dark brown eyes and sets its muzzle on the counter, looking at you plaintively. The Alsatian buried within the cloth looks to you like a big softy, but you're willing to concede the point as made."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitIntro.WorldContinuesShopRun": "[pg]The world continues on though, and she has a shop to run after all; especially if she wants to provide for the hungry mouths that will soon demand her attention."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitSellAllTransact.BenoitBriefestGoingsObjects": "Benoit{0} gives your objects the briefest of goings-over with {1} fingers before stowing them away and handing over your {2} gem reward with a trusting smile."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitSellAllTransact.PainstakingHandsNose": "Following a painstaking examination of the items you've given him with his hands and nose, Benoit grudgingly accepts them and carefully counts out your {0} gem reward."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitSellMenu.EstimatesHeaderBenoit": "[pg]<b><u>Benoit{0}'s Estimates</u></b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitSellMenu.LetUsFeelPalm": "[say: Let us feel what you are trying to palm off upon me zis time, zen,] sighs Benoit{0}, sitting down and opening {1} hand to you."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitSellMenu.NewlineGemsForCount": "\n{0} gems for {1}."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitSellMenu.SellAllStackHint": "[pg](You can shift-click to sell all items in a stack.)"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitSellTransact.BenoitBriefestGoingsOver": "Benoit{0} gives your object the briefest of goings-over with {1} fingers before stowing it away and handing over your gem reward with a trusting smile."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitSellTransact.PainstakingHandsNose": "Following a painstaking examination of what you've given {0} with his hands and nose, Benoit grudgingly accepts it and carefully counts out your reward."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitTransactBuy.AfterExaminingFingersHands": "After examining what you've picked out with {0} fingers, {1} hands it over and accepts your gems with a grin."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitTransactBuy.AfterExaminingNamesPrice": "After examining what you've picked out with {0} fingers, {1} hands it over, names the price and accepts your gems with a curt nod.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitTransactBuy.LackGemsPurchase": "You consider making a purchase, but you lack the gems to go through with it."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitsBuyMenu.NewlineColonOneAgain": "\n{0}: {1}"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitsBuyMenu.NewlineColonOneThird": "\n{0}: {1}"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitsBuyMenu.NewlineZeroColonOne": "\n{0}: {1}"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitsBuyMenu.PricesHeaderPrices": "[pg]<b><u>{0}'s Prices</u></b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitsBuyMenu.SomeCallJunkBuy": "[say: Some may call zis junk,] says Benoite, indicating her latest wares. [say: Me... I call it garbage.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BenoitsBuyMenu.SomeCallZisJunk": "[say: Some may call zis junk,] says Benoit, indicating his latest wares. [say: Me... I call it garbage.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyAlarmClock.DoYouBuyClock": "[pg]Do you buy the clock?"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyAlarmClock.MechanicalClockFlipDisplay": "[pg]It's a mechanical clock. It has a flip display and there are buttons on top of the clock for the purpose of setting time and alarm. You wind up the clock and the display flips, indicating that the clock works. Whoever constructed this clock must have been a genius, you would have even guessed a goblin constructed it before the corruption. You pick up the clock and show it to {0}."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyAlarmClock.WanderShopSearchingClock": "You wander {0}'s shop for a good while as you're searching for something interesting until you spot something interesting."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyAlarmClock.WorksFiveHundred": "[pg][say: It works? I have no need for zis. 500 gems,] {0} says."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyAlarmClockConfirmation.CanSetAlarmCabin": "[pg]<b>You can now set alarm. Go to your cabin to set the alarm. (And change the time when you'll wake up.)</b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyAlarmClockConfirmation.CountBeyondRangeThird": "You count out your gems and realize it's beyond your price range."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyAlarmClockConfirmation.NoNeedZisThird": "[say: Here you go. I have no need for zis,] {0} says."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpack.AskBackpackToSpare": "You ask {0} if {1} has a backpack to spare."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpack.BackpackSizePricings": "[pg]<b><u>Backpack Size and Pricings</u></b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpack.LargeHundredFiveSlots": "\nLarge: 1200 gems, +5 inventory slots"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpack.MediumHundredFourSlots": "\nMedium: 600 gems, +4 inventory slots"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpack.SmallTwoThreeSlots": "\nSmall: 200 gems, +3 inventory slots"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpack.YesThreeSizesWhich": "[pg][say: Yes. Zese come in three sizes. What will you pick?] {0} asks."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpackConfirmation.CountBeyondRangeFourth": "You count out your gems and realize it's beyond your price range."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpackConfirmation.ForTotalOfSlots": " for a total of {0} slots.)</b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpackConfirmation.ForTotalSlotsAgain": " for a total of {0} slots.)</b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpackConfirmation.KeyGainedBackpackSlots": "[pg]<b>(Key Item Gained: {0} Backpack! You now have {1} extra inventory slots"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpackConfirmation.KeyUpgradedBackpackSlots": "[pg]<b>(Key Item Upgraded: {0} Backpack! You now have {1} extra inventory slots"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyBackpackConfirmation.NoNeedZisFourth": "[say: Here you go. I have no need for zis,] {0} says."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyFlintlock.DoYouBuyGun": "[pg]Do you buy the gun? "
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyFlintlock.TimeToTestWeapon": "[pg]Time to test this weapon out. You aim the pistol at one of the empty tin cans and pull the trigger. A round launches from the pistol and hits the tin can, knocking it off shelf. {0} looks in surprise and says, [say: It works? 200 gems and it can be yours.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyFlintlock.WalkOverPickZis": "[pg]You walk over to pick up whatever caught your attention and show it to {0}. [say: Zis? I do know that zis a weapon and it originally belonged to a goblin from long time ago,] {1} says."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyFlintlock.WanderShopSearchingInteresting": "You wander {0}'s shop for a good while as you're searching for something interesting until you spot something interesting."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyFlintlockConfirmation.CountGemsBeyondRange": "You count out your gems and realize it's beyond your price range."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyFlintlockConfirmation.HereNoNeedZis": "[say: Here you go. I have no need for zis,] {0} says."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyMap.DemonTriedZellIt": "[pg][say: Zat? Some demon came here years ago and tried to zell it to me. It might lead to great treasure, so conzider it an investment. 2500 gems,] {0} says."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyMap.HardBargainBuyMap": "[pg]Damn, that's a hard bargain. Do you buy the map?"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyMap.InquireAboutMap": "You inquire {0} about the map."
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyMap.SinceFoundTowerUseless": "\n<b>Since you already found the tower in the Volcanic Crag, this map would likely be of no use to you now.</b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyMapConfirmation.BoughtLeadsVolcanicCrag": "[pg]<b>You have bought a map that leads to some unique location in the Volcanic Crag!</b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyMapConfirmation.CountBeyondRangeAgain": "You count out your gems and realize it's beyond your price range."
