  "Scenes.Benoit.BuyOrSellExplanationFirstTime.SpectacularSalvageBuySell": "[say: If you can see something you want in Benoit's Spectacular Salvage Shop, and you can walk away with it, it's yours,] replies Benoit, theatrically sweeping his claw to take in the entirety of his stall but almost knocking over a birdcage. [say: Assuming you can pay whatever I've decided it's worth, of course. If you want to unload your garbage 'ere? Zis is also fine. I cannot pay what ze fat cats in Tel'Adre can, though. Check back every day; ze Spectacular Salvage Shop always 'as new zings to sell.]"
