  "Scenes.Benoit.FemoitBirths.EnterStallGaspsPain": "As you enter Benoite's stall, you hear the sounds of gasps of pain from the backroom, mingling with the sounds of stock being knocked around. You race through and find Benoite, completely naked, leaning against a table and groaning in anguish, her tail slashing wildly through the air behind her. [say: [name]! It... it iz good zat you are here. Ze eggs! Zey come!]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.FemoitBirths.FlatteryHuskyReptilianBlush": "[pg][say: Flattery,] Benoite declares in her husky voice, a hint of a reptilian blush in her crest, suddenly flush against her head. [say: Now, let us see ze fruits of zis crazy union, shall we?] With your help, she repositions herself so that she can start feeling at the contents of your 'nest', allowing her to touch and count the numbers of her clutch."
  "Scenes.Benoit.FemoitBirths.GladGivingBirthEasier": "[pg]You're glad that giving birth is easier for Benoite than it would be for a mammal, as she needs all the help she can get. Her huge stomach proves that she wasn't merely putting on weight as egg after egg pushes out of her stretched cunt. By the time she's flat as a board again, you've counted her offspring; {0} eggs, each with a baby basilisk still growing inside it."
