  "Scenes.Benoit.FemoitBirths.LayingDoneHeavesSigh": "[pg]Laying done, Benoite heaves a great sigh of relief. [say: Sank goodness zat's over,] she declares, even as she sinks to her knees, careful to avoid crushing the egg"
