  "Scenes.Benoit.SuggestSexAfterBasiWombed.SlidesIntoDepths": " Used to your body now despite {0} blindness, {1} slides straight into your moist depths, making you coo as {2} hard, smooth spur glides across your sensitive walls, slowly bringing himself out before thrusting himself in again, working more and more of {3} long length into you. Never quite able to control himself around your body, it's obvious in the strain of the muscles pressed against you and the raggedness of {4} breath upon your skin that {5} is exercising every restraint {6} has not to fuck you into the ground; {7} pushes {8} dick downwards with each return thrust to bump deliberately against your [clit], sending irresistible spasms of pleasure chiming through you. You slowly move forwards until your arms are braced against the wall, before gritting over your shoulder to {9} to stop holding back. {10} pauses for a moment to gather {11} breath, hilted entirely in your wet cunt, then hooks {12} strong arms around your back end, entrapping you around {13} body, before beginning to fuck your softened, ripe body like a jackhammer. {14} pounds into you with everything {15}'s got, clenching you as your gushing [vagina] deliriously spatters fluids across your entwined bodies."
  "Scenes.Benoit.SuggestSexAfterBasiWombed.SmileCoquettishlyTestDrive": "You smile coquettishly and ask if {0}'s interested in taking your new body for a... test drive. "
  "Scenes.Benoit.SuggestSexAfterBasiWombed.StaggersBackRoomBumping": "{0} staggers into the back room, bumping into several things as {1} sets you down, thankfully onto a clear space on the ground. {2} leans into you, {3} weight pushing you onto the ground, hands flying over your [armor], fumbling off clasps and belts when {4} finds them. Now that your gut has settled you feel imbued with an odd, ripe sensation; your belly bulges ever-so-slightly with unfertilized eggs and you feel red, soft and ready. You work with {5}, wriggling out of your clothes and ripping {6} own trousers off, spreading your [hips] eagerly as {7} long, smooth prick springs to attention."
  "Scenes.Benoit.SuggestSexAfterBasiWombed.VoiceSoLowAgain": "[pg][say: Do you sink it will really work?] says {0} eventually, {1} voice so low it is barely above a murmur. [say: What if I can only give you males?] The thought has already occurred to you, but you are feeling in a playful mood. {2} dick is still inside you and has barely softened, despite the volume of cum it is plugging into you; grinning, you push backwards, sitting yourself down so that {3} is trapped under your bestial weight. You look over your shoulder and lock eyes with {4} as you very slowly work your powerful hips in a circular motion, back and forth, deliberately working the cock wedged inside of you until it starts to inexorably harden again; {5} closes {6} eyes and grunts as you abuse {7} aching sex. You softly tell {8} as you wring {9} that whether or not you are able to give birth to female basilisks, {10}'s the father to your children now and that mommy needs- you thrust your hips as far forwards as you can, bending {11} dick backwards to make your point - service. Lots and lots of service. Driven by your words and your merciless sex, {12} closes {13} eyes, clutches your flanks and helplessly orgasms a second time, spurting one or two more gobs of cum into you before {14} cock flexes fruitlessly against your sopping walls."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TakeBenoitsContraceptives.GladlyHerbalContraceptive": "You gladly accept the herbal contraceptive and push it into your mouth, enjoying the pleasantly sharp, citrus flavor."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AWhatWord": "[pg][say: A what?]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AdBeenOpingSpeak": "[say: Ah [name]! I 'ad been 'oping to speak wiz you.] your basilisk lover says with a toothy smile. [say: I 'ave a gift for you... For all you 'ave done.] You notice{0}{1}'s face turn a deeper green, evidently blushing as {2} thrusts out a closed palm, gaze averted like a kid on Valentines Day. You place your hand out and feel something small fall into your palm. It tickles and feels cool. You look down at the trinket you have received, immediately surprised."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AfraidCannotBeElpful": "[pg][say: I'm afraid I cannot be very 'elpful zeir, [name],] {0} sighs. [say: Unless you want me to tell you what zey smell like. I do not sink you want to be knowing zis. Ze demons, zey were not much in ze business of telling us what zeir plans were, and zey did not much like 'anging around us, which is understandable. Zair is every treasure you can ever imagine in ze magpie room, but zeir is no way you could ever get at zem unless you could work out some way of making many undreds of basilisks close zeir eyes at once.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AfterFewMomentsNods": "[pg]After a few moments {0} nods slightly."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AlwaysWorkedSalvage": "[pg][say: I 'ave always worked with salvage,] {0} shrugs. [say: Back in ze mountains I worked in ze magpie room - obviously, because I was no good on ze outside. You can tell from ze weight of sings, and 'ow zey smell, what it is and 'ow much it is worth. More zan zat you can tell... what it meant to its last owner. Zat is ze true worse of an object.] {1} taps his claws on the counter, lost in thought. [say: Ze magpie room is amazing, [name], I wish I could show it to you. Such good acoustics, filled with ze sound and smell of a thousand pieces of junk - every day a new symphony. And 'oo would ever steal ze demons' treasures? You would 'ave to be mad to try to steal from a hall full of basilisks. Or blind.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AnswersWarilyDoubleDose": "[pg]Benoit answers warily. [say: A double dose of ovi-elixer, a bottle of reptilum, goblin ale and some basilisk blood would probably do... if you were so minded. But, [name], tell me you're not going to do somesing so reckless as experiment on your body?]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskAboutAboveShop": "You ask {0} about the sign above the shop."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskAboutBazaar": "You ask Benoit if {0} can tell you anything about the Bazaar."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskAboutDog": "You ask {0} about the dog."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskAllBasilisksTalk": "You ask if all basilisks talk as {0} does."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskAlwaysBeenBlind": "You ask if {0} has always been blind."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskBasilisksMateHarpies": "You ask [benoit name] what results when basilisks mate with harpies."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskBenoiteIntendsMountains": "You ask Benoite if she intends to go back to the mountains now. She laughs long and hard at this. One thing the transformation has certainly gifted her is an extraordinarily filthy laugh."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskBenoiteTellSmell": "You ask Benoite if she really can tell who you are just by smell."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskGettingOppositeSex": "You ask Benoite how she's getting on with being the opposite sex. Benoite stops cleaning the tarnished silver plate in her hands to think."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskGotLineWork": "You ask {0} how {1} got into this line of work."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskPetrifyingEffectGaze": "You ask {0} how the petrifying effect of {1} brethren's gaze works, is it something their eyes naturally do or type of sight? {2} stiffens for a moment before letting out a frustrated sigh."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskReallyCanTell": "You ask Benoit if {0} really, <b>really</b> can tell who you are just by smell."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskRumorsGoingAround": "You ask {0} for any rumors going around."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskSuggestFightBrethren": "You ask Benoit if {0} can suggest anything to help you fight his brethren in the high mountains."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskTellBySmell": "You ask if {0} really can tell who you are just by smell."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskThoughtHelpPeople": "You ask {0} if {1} has ever thought about trying to do something to help his people's plight."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskThoughtsFrontCustomer": "[pg]You ask if she's had any thoughts on that front. [say: Well, I do 'ave zis one customer 'oo seems very kind. And 'oo knows me a great deal better zan anyone else around 'ere,] Benoite mumbles, twiddling her fingers. [say: But zis person 'as already done a great deal for me, so I don't know if... per'aps zis is asking too much. I will find someone though, never fear. As I said before...] Benoite points two fingers at her blind eyes and then at the stall entrance. There's a distinct gleam in those cloudy gray depths you think would scare the hell out of most things with a penis. [say: I 'ave a purpose now.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskThoughtsNotReally": "You ask if she's had any thoughts on that front. [say: Not really,] Benoite sighs. [say: I 'ave many male customers but zey all 'ave - 'ow you say? Rough round edges. You now 'ow it is, [name], all men are pigs.] You both laugh at this. [say: I will find someone though, don't worry. As I said before...] she points two fingers at her blind eyes and then at the stall entrance. There's a distinct gleam in those cloudy gray depths you think would scare the hell out of most things with a penis. [say: I 'ave a purpose now.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskTroubleWithDemons": "You ask if {0}'s ever had any trouble with the demons who frequent the Bazaar."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskUsefulDemonStrongholds": "You ask Benoit there is anything useful {0} can tell you about the demon strongholds."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskWhatRedIs": "[pg]You ask what red is."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskWorriedCustomersNotice": "[pg]You ask Benoite if she isn't worried that demon customers won't notice what she is."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.AskingBlindPersonSniggers": "[pg][say: You are really asking zis question to a blind person?] comes the reply. [say: Ok, I will tell you what I know, for what it is worth. Over zeir by ze fire, I know zeir are lizans having a good time, because zey shout insults when zey get really drunk. Zey would get violent with me I sink, if it weren't for Pierre. Zeir leader has a big problem with her male hormones, judging from ze way she smells.] {0} sniggers with a distinct lack of sympathy. [say: In ze uzzer direction, I can smell a lot of males together in one place. Smell like zey are doing something very macho - and a bit painful, from ze sound of zeir walk afterwards.] {1} points in the opposite direction. [say: Zerr are plenty of, ow you say, crumpets who work around here. Some of zem can do some pretty wild sings for you, for a fee. Or so I'm told.] {2} coughs."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.BasiliskEyesOptionEnabled": "[pg](<b>Basilisk Eyes option enabled in {0}'s menu!</b>)"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.BasiliskWombOptionEnabled": "[pg](<b>Basilisk Womb option enabled in Benoit's menu!</b>)"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.BeeMaidenAfterMoment": "[pg][say: Bee maiden,] says Benoit after a moment."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.BlushCreepThankHugging": "[pg]You feel a blush creep across your [face] as you thank the blind basilisk, hugging {0} to you tight before you leave"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.CarryMirrorPointing": "[pg][say: You could carry a mirror with you,] {0} says, pointing. [say: There's one over zair, isn't zair?] You report that it is cracked badly - at any rate, you're not carrying a bulky mirror up a mountain two or three times a day. [say: I will give it to you half price,] {1} says hopefully. [say: Sink 'ow useful it will be to check for transformations! You could get somebody else to carry it for you... ok, alright, so you don't want ze mirror. Most prey, my bruzzers are expecting zem to lash out in a panic. So use sings which do not involve approaching. We do not like magic or ranged sings, zey are too unpredictable - I suggest using zem.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.CertainlySmellShavedAgain": "[pg][say: Certainly!] {0} smiles. [say: Ze smell of shaved monkey is distinctive. I get very few 'uman customers, you know.] You look down at yourself, then back at the basilisk suspiciously, before saying you don't much look or feel human. [say: Oh, I do not doubt zat,] says the trader. [say: You 'umans and your flexible genes - zat makes you very alluring, as I am sure you 'ave already noticed, eh? I am sure somebody 'oo relied upon sight would not be able to tell you are 'uman. But 'oo you are underneath all zat, zat never changes, and I can smell zat. All you are doing really is dressing up as something else. If you wanted to, you could change back tomorrow, if you 'ad ze right ingredienns.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.CertainlySmellShavedMonkey": "[pg][say: Certainly!] {0} smiles. [say: Ze smell of shaved monkey is distinctive. I get very few 'uman customers, you know.] The basilisk scratches {1} jaw absent-mindedly. [say: If you do not mind me saying so, [name], you also smell... different. Like you do not really belong 'ere. In ze nicest possible way, of course.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.CharmingYouSay": "[pg]Charming, you say."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.CunningDisguiseLargeBeret": "[pg][say: Zat is why I am wearing zis cunning disguise,] she says, patting her large beret. She lowers her voice to a growl. [say: And I talk like zis when I am serving zem. Grr. To be honest I do not sink I 'ave to be worrying much,] she goes on in her normal tone, tightening her apron. [say: Most of ze demons 'oo come 'ere are not very bright, zey are not very interested in anysing except when zey are next banging zair bits together. Also I sink most mammals are 'aving trouble telling ze difference between male and female reptiles wizzout looking closely. Am I right?] She grins her long, meandering smile at you and you take her point."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.DifferentEventuallyLaughing": "[pg][say: It is... different,] she says eventually, before laughing at the platitude. [say: Ze 'ole wizzing situation, zis is terrible for instance. I do not know [name], I am so busy during ze day and it 'appened so suddenly, it is difficult to properly reflect. Sometimes I am sinking somesing, like 'ow somesing smells, and zen I catch myself sinking... would Benoit 'ave sought zat? Is my perception different because I 'ave different 'ormones swirling around my 'ead?] She turns the plate around in her hands absently. [say: Zerr are... uzzer sings, too. Sometimes I am smelling a customer is finding me strange, and I realize I am doing somesing which is... male. Like, somesing I would never 'ave sought about before, walking with feet splayed instead of in a line. A 'undred and one sings to remember to not stand out. Zat is wearying.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.DoKnowAmBlind": "[pg][say: [name], you do know I am blind yes? Zis is not somesing to joke about.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.DontKnowAppening": "[pg][say: I don't know what is 'appening exactly,] {0} says, leaning over the counter. [say: But ze demons 'oo I trade with, zey seem very worked up about somesing. Sumsing went wrong at one of zeir facilities, I sink. I also hear a number of passers-by talking about ze lake. Apparently it is much cleaner now; many are going back to use it for water. Now if only someone could make zose crazy cultists go away, eh?]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.DontKnowWhatAppening": "[pg][say: I don't know what is 'appening exactly,] {0} says, leaning over the counter. [say: But ze demons 'oo I trade with, zey seem very worked up about sumsing. Sumsing went wrong at one of zeir facilities, I sink. I also get a number of shark ladies coming in ere, asking if I sell fresh water. Zey also seem very unhappy.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.DontKnowWhatRed": "[pg][say: I don't know,] {0} says. [say: Ask me what red is.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.ExplainUnitaurWhiteCentaur": "[pg]You explain that a Unitaur is like a white centaur, only it has a horse's face. It has massively strong human arms though, and it can cast magic better than anyone, and it can go faster than a cheetah, and... you can't help yourself and begin to giggle at the expression of terror that has emerged on Benoit's face."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.FindHybridsHighMountains": "[pg]<b>Perhaps you should try to find one of these elusive hybrids. You suspect the high mountains would be the best place to look.</b>"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.GainedFeatheryHairPin": "[pg](<b>Gained Key Item: Feathery hair-pin</b>)"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.GentleHummingNoise": "[pg]You make a gentle humming noise."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.GnollWord": "[say: Gnoll.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.GrinsWiderAffectedHurt": "[pg]Benoite grins wider at your affected hurt. [say: Oh do not worry [name], you 'ave a beautiful personality. And ow important exactly do you sink your personal appearance is to me?]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.HintLongingJealousy": " There's a hint of longing jealousy in the basilisk's voice and when {0} lapses into silence you decide not to push the subject."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.HoldSilverHairPin": "[pg]You hold a silver hair pin, its shining exterior glittering in the light. Tiny scales are cast into the metal of the pin as though it were the tail of a reptile, something that must have taken master craftsmanship to form so well. At the end is a ovoid gemstone, a swirling gray pattern deep within it. You are reminded of the eyes of basilisks in the mountains, though this time, you look at it because it is beautiful, rather than through compulsion. Under the gem is a plume of three delicate crimson feathers, their soft fibers tickling your palm. Surely {0} didn't mean to give you such an expensive looking item?!"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.HowShouldIKnow": "[pg][say: 'Ow ze fuck should I know?] the basilisk replies, deadpan. [say: Stop asking stupid questions.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.HurriedlyTellNotCruel": "[pg]You hurriedly tell your scaled lover that you didn't mean it in a cruel way, you were merely curious. After all, you've transformed yourself to become more basilisk like for {0} already, so you're curious if you could get even closer to being a true basilisk."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.LaughsThroatilyRottenSour": "[pg]{0} laughs throatily, then sighs. [say: Ah, but it was rotten, really - always a sour note underneath everysing. A thousand basilisks, driven by nussing but greed and lust. I got sick of it, being stuck in zat place with zose thoughts, zat 'opeless cycle, and one day ran away. I took what I could carry and used zat to start up here. Away from ze mountains, I can zink clearly. I can say what ze uzzer basilisks only know at ze back of zeir minds.] {1} slams a fist into the counter, making you jump. [say: Don't ever make a deal with a demon, [name],] {2} says, voice thick with rage. [say: Even when you sink it is a win-win? Zey will still find a way to fuck you good.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.MindWandersTurnBasilisk": "[pg]Your mind wanders. You doubt that even if you wanted to you could turn into a basilisk proper, but you wonder if there's some kind of transformation that would allow a human womb to mimic that of another race."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.MinotaurImmediatelyTooGood": "[pg][say: Minotaur,] says Benoit immediately. You sigh - {0}'s too good at this game, and you're running out of creatures. Thinking briefly, you make a clop-clopping whilst slapping the counter, throwing in a bit of heavy breathing for good measure."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.MostZeTimeBasilisks": "[pg][say: Most of ze time? Basilisks,] [benoit ey] replies, carefully counting gems with [benoit eir] fingers. [say: Some of ze time? 'Arpies. But ze arpies feed zeir basilisk children to zeir chicks if ze former do not get away in time, so it works out. Really, we are doing zem and ze world a favor by stealing zeir eggs - if we weren't around ze 'ole world would be drowned in guano by now.] Satisfied with the takings, [benoit ey] stows the money away underneath the counter. [say: Very rarely, you get cockatrices. Now ZEY are weird-looking.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.NodsThoughtfullyNeverSought": "[pg]Benoite nods thoughtfully. [say: I never sought about it like zat. Ze demons just love slaves zey can change wizzer a few potions, don't zey? You are right [name], I will count my blessings in ze future.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.NotAnysingInterestingCustomers": "[pg][say: Not anysing very interesting,] {0} shrugs. [say: I get a few customers from ze desert city, Tel'Adre, coming in 'ere in secret to pick up a few sings zey cannot find back 'ome. So zey are still a sing. You 'ave to wonder ow much longer zey can keep hiding, though.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.NotDontLikeZem": "[pg][say: Not really,] {0} replies. [say: I don't like zem, but zey are my main source of income. Zey are always coming in here to sell zeir fluids. The truth is it's worthless - I pour most of ze disgusting stuff away. But it is worth paying for zeir custom because zey are always buying many more potions. It isn't a good demon party unless you 'ave sprouted two new dicks and four new nipples for it, apparently. Always one of zem is asking if zey can 'do ze dinosaur' as way of payment. I 'ate zem so much.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.NotToDisillusionBlind": "[pg]You decide not to disillusion the blind basilisk."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.NotToPursueSubject": "[pg]You decide not to pursue the subject."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.NussingCanPay": "[pg][say: [name], nussing can pay for what you 'ave done for me, for my kind. Such an 'eirloom is paltry to zat.] {0} says softly, eyes closed. [say: It does not feel warped by ze demons, and I am 'oping it reminds you of me in your travels.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.OhSeePullingTail": "[pg][say: Oh, I see. You are pulling my tail. Very amusing.] You laugh even harder at the expression of wounded dignity which replaces the terror."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.OnlyZisSideMountain": "[pg][say: Only on zis side of ze mountain,] comes the reply. [say: Ze uzzer side are all stuck-up snobs who speak 'orribly. Zey are all pale and flabby too, and zeir cooking is terrible. Pwah!] {0} makes an exasperated gesture with a claw."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.PierreGivingTroubleMutt": "[pg][say: Pierre 'asn't been giving you trouble, as 'e? Big stupid mutt does not know 'is mouth from 'is arse. Which is why 'e checks so often,] says the basilisk fondly, rubbing the Alsatian behind his ear. [say: I found 'im prowling around eating scraps from ze food sellers when I first got ere; I sink 'e must 'ave belonged to anuzzer trader 'oo left 'im behind. I do not sink I could run this shop without 'im - every evening I go out into the wilds with 'im and 'unt down more salvage. 'Ee is so good at finding perfectly good sings other people 'ave left behind. Particularly cloze. 'E loves robes, Pierre. Don't you, boy?] Pierre whines."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.PointOutMutabilityAdvantage": "[pg]You point out that your mutability is not always an advantage- it can be used against you, and this land is full of types who would be only too keen to do so."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.ProudRaceOnceNoble": "[pg][say: We were a proud race once,] sighs Benoit. [say: A noble race, who carried our 'eads 'igh, and...] the blind basilisk bursts into throaty laughter, which eventually subsides into a coughing fit. You watch, bemused. [say: Hahaha! Aha. Sorry. No, we were always a race of egg-thieving bastards. The lizans,] {0} flicks {1}{2} in the general direction of the bonfire with disdain, [say: absolutely 'ate us. Zey drove us to live in ze mountains, far away from zeir precious clutches, to live like savages. 'Ze family with ze evil eye over it', zat's what zey call us. Eh... in basilisk it's more snappy.] Benoit pauses, running his fingers over the counter ruminatively. [say: But it wasn't so bad, up zair. We kept ze harpies under control, and we collected scrap, sold it to zose who were brave enough to trade blindfolded. We've always been good at zat. Zen ze demons came to ze mountains.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.RackCantThinkAnything": "[pg]You rack your brain but can't think of anything that could help Benoit, so you end up simply sympathizing with {0}. [say: Do not beat yourself up over it,] says the basilisk, touching the tips of your fingers and smiling warmly. [say: It is just foolishness. And anyway, I told you: we are a race of bastards. We are ze last guys who deserve someone sinking after us.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.RecklessExperimentOnYourself": "[pg][say: I see... are you sure about zis [name]? It is so reckless to experiment on your body like zis... But I suppose you have done so much for my folk, zat if you wish to be one of us, I could look into it. Beware though, zey are dangerous, so while I shall do zis to thank you, I do not wish to risk you becoming like ze others... Ze demons no doubt affected our gaze too, ze perverts...]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.RubsPierreBehindEar": "[pg]The basilisk rubs Pierre behind the ear as {0} thinks. [say: I did once get a group of demons coming in ere, asking me what 'cheese omelette' is in basilisk. When I told zem, zey ran away laughing, shouting 'Zat is all you can say! Zat is all you can say!'] {1} shrugs, irritated. [say: Arseholes.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.SentencePeriod": "."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.ShrugsWhatToDo": "[pg]He shrugs. [say: What were we going to do? Go down and throw ourselves on the mercy of the races 'oo despise us? Ze demons offered to set us high in zeir service, augment our natural abilities if we agreed to help zem. I suppose zey did, at zat.] Benoit scratches a long groove in his counter, trembling with anger. [say: By making us all male zey made sure we are always fixated on finding egg bearers, on keeping ze harpies down, and bringing scrap and statues to zem so zey don't do anysing worse to us. We are just a brainless natural defense to zem now, in zeir mountain hideaways. Don't go up ze mountain or ze evil basilisks will get you! Bastards. Bastards.] Benoit finishes mutilating the wood in front of {0} and sighs. [say: But zat is by ze by. Are you going to buy sumsing or not?]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.SilentClawsAlongCounter": "[pg]The basilisk is silent for a time, running his claws along the counter pensively. [say: Yes,] {0} says eventually, in a quiet tone. [say: I 'ave. Away from ze mountains, I 'ave 'ad time to sink. I am not ze demons' slave anymore, and I am a funny joke of a basilisk anyway, so I 'ave often thought about... making certain zacrifices. If we 'ad just one female, away from zeir corruption, zen...] {1} trails off, sighing heavily before smiling ruefully at you. [say: Zose were ze kind of soughts I 'ad before I met you. Crazy, yes? Even more crazy to be still sinking zem when a good woman is giving me 'er love for no reason except through ze kindness of 'er 'art. Still... it is so frustrating, being able to sink clearly about zese sings and not being able to do anysing about it.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.SlippingPinIntoHair": ", slipping the pin into your [hair] as you exit the store."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.SmileAtConcernLeaving": "[pg]You smile at the lizard's concern for you before leaving {0} to find a recipe in peace."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.SmilesLuckyOneRespect": "[pg]She smiles shyly at you. [say: I am very lucky in one respect zo, because I 'ave not 'ad to resink what I find attractive to lie wizz you. Whatever you 'ave between your legs you smell and feel female to me, and zat is a comfort.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.SmilesShylyHadResink": "She smiles shyly at you. [say: One sing I 'ave definitely 'ad to resink is what I find attractive. I did not find ze male form attractive before, so for my body to... respond... when you are close, zat is when I most feel ze disconnect between my experience and what I am now. Per'aps zis is also why I 'ave not sought about it too much; it is better just to rely on instinct.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.SmilesShylyListenRiveting": "[pg]She smiles shyly at you. [say: Listen to me, ow you say, riveting on. You I am guessing do not see what ze big fuss is- you 'umans can chop and change whenever you feel like, so to speak. Must be nice.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.SoFondlyHowLong": "[pg][say: Oh [name], you are so silly,] she says fondly. [say: 'Ow long do you sink a blind female basilisk would last up zair, eh? If I was really lucky ze minotaurs would get me before ze demons did. No, I will stay ere. Ze uzzer basilisks, I cannot trust zem - zey are always exposed to ze corruption, some of zem even like it. I will lay eggs far away from zere, I will raise my children to be different; away from ze corruption and with equal numbers of males and females, it will be different. Zere are many empty places in zis world now zey can go to and be left alone.] She pauses. [say: Or at least zese sings will 'appen once I work up ze courage to find a, er, donor.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.SomesingStrangeZisserDay": "[pg][say: Somesing strange did 'appen ze uzzer day, now you mention it,] {0} says, tapping a curved tooth. [say: I got a big group of imps in ere. I normally don't serve zem because zey are always stealing sings whilst one of zem is paying, but zese guys seemed too worked up to even sink about lifting ze shop - zey smelt of fear. Zey were buying lots of food and survival gear - one of zem kept going on and on about ze fact zey left \"ze faerie\" behind, until one of ze uzzers slapped 'im and said if 'ee didn't shut up, 'ee would be ze faerie.] {1} shrugs. [say: Nasty little sings. Tasty, though.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.StampFeetSnuffleSnort": "[pg]You stamp your feet and snuffle and snort."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.TakeMomentLookMerchant": "You take a moment to look the strange merchant over. Although blind, {0} doesn't seem very old - {1} retains the tight, thin muscular frame of other basilisks you've seen, but looks to be slightly shorter and for all his proud, cruel profile seems slightly shabby around the edges. In what is presumably a nod towards civilized manners, {2} is wearing a pair of denim long johns as well as his fez, perched upon one of his head spines. You introduce yourself, and then decide to ask {3} about basilisks."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.TraderSaysProudlyCatguy": "[pg][say: It's good, isn't it?] the trader says proudly. [say: I got a catguy to do it when I first got 'ere and didn't know ze language so well. 'E suggested...] {0} spreads {1} claws expressively. [say: 'Salamander's Salubrious Salvage'. Because, everyone likes salamanders, and once zey get in and realize I am not a salamander and it is just a play on words, zey would be so entranced by what I am selling zey would not care.] {2} taps the counter happily. [say: In gold print, too! It is a surprise it has not brought more customers in.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.UnitaurWord": "Unitaur."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.WellOfCourseTeasingly": "[pg][say: Well, of course I can,] {0} says teasingly. [say: When you end up smelling like someone else for several hours, it is a difficult sing to mistake. It is a memento of you and it reminds me of 'appiness; I wish I could smell zat way for longer. My sexy little shaved monkey.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.WellOfCourseZilly": "[pg][say: Well, of course I can, zilly,] she says teasingly. [say: When you end up smelling like someone else for several hours, it is a difficult sing to mistake. It is a memento of you and it reminds me of appiness; I wish I could smell zat way for longer. My sexy little shaved monkey.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TalkToBenoit.WhatZeEllSupposed": "[pg][say: What ze 'ell is zat supposed to be?] says Benoit, looking alarmed. You tell him it's a "
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.BasiliskStillSuddenSurge": " The basilisk is still for a moment, and then with a sudden surge of movement, grabs you by the waist and hoists you over {0} shoulder. You squeal in mock terror as {1} hauls you as fast as {2} can into the back room, knocking over half {3} stock as {4} does."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.BasiliskStillSurgeAgain": " The basilisk is still for a moment, and then with a sudden surge of movement, grabs you by the waist and frenetically attempts to hoist you over {0} shoulder. You are far too big for {1} though; after several valiant attempts, {2} collapses against a shelf. Laughing, you pick the stricken, panting reptile up, hoist {3} over your own shoulder, and navigate a path into the back room."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.DontHaveNecessaryIngredients": "You don't have the necessary ingredients to attempt this yet. You recall {0} mentioning that you would need Reptilum, two Ovi Elixirs, and Goblin Ale."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.FerretIngredientsBangCounter": "You ferret out the ingredients you have collected and begin to bang them onto the counter in front of {0}, telling {1} that you've got what {2} needs. Pierre barks excitedly at the noise."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.ForgiveMeClearlyTroubled": "[say: Forgive me, [name],] Benoit says, clearly troubled, as you begin hauling out the ingredients and announcing your plan. [say: I sink your body is already stressed enough wis 'aving to pump so little blood so far... I would razer you not take furzer risks on my account until your form is more... compact. I cannot be a part of zis... 'owever much I would like to. You mean too much to me, you see.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.GrinNotSureAgain": " You grin and say you're not even sure it worked... but you'll be back at some point to try it out, and {0}'d better be ready for when you do. You gently pry yourself out of {1} grip and leave as deliberately as you can, aware of the beguiling, invisible scent you are leaving for the stunned, silent basilisk to simmer in."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.GrinNotSureWorked": " You grin and say you're not sure it worked, but you suppose there's only one real way of finding out..."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.LeftSpeechlessFranknessBag": "[pg]Left speechless by {0} frankness, you can only sweep the items back into your bag."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.MixtureLingeringBiteMint": "[pg]The mixture has a lingering bite of mint overlaying the all-consuming burn of alcohol; you are reminded vaguely of the sticky liqueurs that populated the recesses of cupboards back home. You smack your lips and plonk the bowl back down with deliberate loudness after you have finished; {0} clutches the counter tensely as you wait. You haven't died straight away, so that's a positive... an immense gurgle comes from your belly and you double over as your insides shift and the contents of your gut churn. The sensation is not painful exactly but you feel like you've lost all control of your insides; you clutch your sides and try to breathe levelly as your stomach turns upside down and makes a sound like trapped gas. Eventually you feel something like a bubble form just below your gut; slowly your insides settle as the bubble grows larger and larger, until the sensation slowly fades. Cautiously you walk back and forth a few times, before poking your tummy."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.OffFeetAroundCounter": "[pg][say: Really?] The basilisk is off {0} feet and around the counter faster than you gave {1} credit for. [say: You are not just high from ze goblin ale?] {2} holds you around the waist and breathes you in slowly. [say: You... you are not joking.] {3} sounds shell-shocked. [say: You really did it. You... really did mean to do zis.]"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.PerkUnlockedBasiliskWomb": "[pg](<b>Perk Unlocked: Basilisk Womb - You can now give birth to female basilisks.</b>)"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.PerkUnlockedOviposition": "[pg](<b>Perk Unlocked: Oviposition - You will now regularly lay unfertilized eggs.</b>)"
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.SaysNervouslyRightSawbones": "[pg][say: [name]?] says {0} nervously. [say: Are you all right? Shall I call ze sawbones? I will call ze sawbones. 'E is mostly good at taking people apart and putting zem back togezzer again, but I am sure 'e can give you a good purgative if we rush...] You toy with the idea of staging a dramatic allergic reaction, but deciding not to fray {1} nerves any further you tell {2} you feel absolutely fine. Indeed, stroking your belly, you are almost certain that it worked."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.SlightlyBloatedOtherwiseFine": " You feel slightly bloated, but otherwise fine; you sense that you can lay eggs of your own volition now."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.SlightlyBloatedWereImpregnated": "You feel slightly bloated, but otherwise fine; you sense that were you to get impregnated by basilisk seed, the eggs you produce would be pure basilisk."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.SunTooLong": "[pg][say: You 'ave been in ze sun too long [name],] says the basilisk harshly, clutching {0} hand. [say: Go 'ave a lie down and zen resink drinking whatever it is you 'ave just concocted. I never asked for you to try zis.] You feel a moment of doubt... but no, you've poured good ingredients into this and you sure as hell aren't going to wimp out now. You give {1}'s uninjured hand a reassuring squeeze and say with as much confidence as you can muster that you know what you're doing. With that, you cup the bowl, and with only a moment's hesitation, drink deeply."
  "Scenes.Benoit.TryToConvertToBassyWomb.WhatIsZatBewildered": "[pg][say: And what is zat?] the basilisk says, bewildered. You explain you can whip something up which will give you a basilisk womb - and hence, female basilisk kids. {0} opens {1} mouth then closes it again; it takes {2} a while to properly compute these words. [say: But... but zat is completely impossible, [name]!] {3} says eventually, wringing {4} hands. [say: 'Ow do you know you won't just poison yourself? Or, or turn yourself into a newt or somesing? Please... don't 'urt... I should never 'ave said...] {5} lapses into silence as you grab a pewter bowl from a nearby shelf and a wooden spoon from a container full of old utensils, and begin to mix the various ingredients together. You pour the ovi-elixers into the goblin ale, beating them together until a fairly unpleasant sulfuric smell fills the close market stall. Carefully you dribble the reptilum in whilst continuing to stir, until the smell changes to that of cooking sherry. You frown at the mixture. It feels like it's missing something... Casually, you ask {6} to open {7} hand to you, whilst plucking a kitchen knife from the utensil container. {8} barks in pain as you run the blade across {9} palm and then hold {10} hand firmly over the bowl. Drops of dark red blossom into the mixture, and as you carefully stir the potion turns a green-gray color: the color of {11}'s scales."
}
